SUMMARY:Inaugural NetSec Management Committee plenary
DESCRIPTION:The Action's first formal Management Committee plenary\, bringing together the MC representatives from the participating COST Member countries to align on workstreams\, confirm Working Group leadership for the coming cycle\, and elect any remaining roles. Followed by a Core Group working session.\n\nAccess is restricted to MC representatives\, Working Group leads\, and invited observers.
